{"kind": "blogger#post", "id": "1195860256229786875", "blog": {"id": "489843540806914986"}, "published": "2025-11-11T18:17:00-08:00", "updated": "2026-03-04T17:14:31-08:00", "url": "https://www.cocosedu.co.kr/2025/11/1-1.html", "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/blogger/v3/blogs/489843540806914986/posts/1195860256229786875", "title": "코코스학원 예비중1, 예비고1 영어 모집안내", "content": "<h2 style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">코코스학원 예비중1, 예비고1 영어 모집안내</h2><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDNalw5xfbTfzJvLt32mH_ao0nHjfx8-G73FvPbrOJc8I14G8XMGxCsz1C5vE5FM4AqC4p04qEdCgtnwbbA-SjWww6DzR2djF2PE2jyTBSqs4qttYySLhBd4Q2w9XQwTMwz8eE6LVp_3FWRyWdvBDa5EiArSiG9vYRqQnHMXp_wjSXBy7ieLhCsWQuloJR/s1864/%E1%84%89%E1%85%B3%E1%84%8F%E1%85%B3%E1%84%85%E1%85%B5%E1%86%AB%E1%84%89%E1%85%A3%E1%86%BA%202025-11-22%20%E1%84%8B%E1%85%A9%E1%84%8C%E1%85%A5%E1%86%AB%209.18.33.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1042\" data-original-width=\"1864\" height=\"358\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDNalw5xfbTfzJvLt32mH_ao0nHjfx8-G73FvPbrOJc8I14G8XMGxCsz1C5vE5FM4AqC4p04qEdCgtnwbbA-SjWww6DzR2djF2PE2jyTBSqs4qttYySLhBd4Q2w9XQwTMwz8eE6LVp_3FWRyWdvBDa5EiArSiG9vYRqQnHMXp_wjSXBy7ieLhCsWQuloJR/w640-h358/%E1%84%89%E1%85%B3%E1%84%8F%E1%85%B3%E1%84%85%E1%85%B5%E1%86%AB%E1%84%89%E1%85%A3%E1%86%BA%202025-11-22%20%E1%84%8B%E1%85%A9%E1%84%8C%E1%85%A5%E1%86%AB%209.18.33.png\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n\n<blockquote style=\"background: rgb(249, 249, 249); border-left: 6px solid rgb(76, 132, 255); border-radius: 10px; line-height: 1.8; padding: 22px;\">\n  <b>코코스학원 예비중·예비고 프로그램 안내</b><br /><br />\n  아이의 현재 수준을 정확히 진단하고 필요한 부분만 집중 강화하는 맞춤형 수업을 제공합니다.<br />\n  단순 강의가 아닌 학습 태도·습관·결과까지 관리하는 책임형 시스템으로 성장을 이끕니다.<br />\n  학교 내신과 수능 기초까지 동시에 잡을 수 있도록 단계별 로드맵을 마련합니다.<br />\n  중·고등 상위권 학생들이 꾸준히 성과를 내며 신뢰를 쌓아온 검증된 프로그램입니다.<br />\n  분당 이매·판교 지역에서 안정적인 성적 향상을 원하는 부모님들께 가장 많이 선택받고 있습니다.\n</blockquote>\n\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYKN21VEBbjhfXtx-MNFqBqoic8x-SeSHOZyTt05SQoN2gJYJ08bg3OVVrcZqeTICg0pi1Gnq-SqGq7bTcnUw0kSYLZDah_5Dun3MLgFwDAmdMz4xRCIi7m3meTDKNn0WjVw9lSHD_rjyS2NfIgWDMbPwLKXbi1c1_wqbdM3NG2Tz0GpztuRwwLCJi2cil/s3538/예비고 시안.jpeg\">\n    <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYKN21VEBbjhfXtx-MNFqBqoic8x-SeSHOZyTt05SQoN2gJYJ08bg3OVVrcZqeTICg0pi1Gnq-SqGq7bTcnUw0kSYLZDah_5Dun3MLgFwDAmdMz4xRCIi7m3meTDKNn0WjVw9lSHD_rjyS2NfIgWDMbPwLKXbi1c1_wqbdM3NG2Tz0GpztuRwwLCJi2cil/s16000/예비고 시안.jpeg\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 4px 12px; width: 100%;\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh2Ap4o_ntBsKSjsQX6SeRn88RBPiamhg4NSXfycer-2NotBOVCeh2aziJZCMMHXlGPU9gVDJWm65Sv_uhZyXxUu60iEc50UWP4_eYt5Mn9co-Seue-Qq4wUk2edBL0XqT3ayrcOgu7r1lvq8XTlnq7-M-Q5AAHOnwYu4isadApBY4i7p_UNiGETvz1wSpJ/s4272/코코스 강좌.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh2Ap4o_ntBsKSjsQX6SeRn88RBPiamhg4NSXfycer-2NotBOVCeh2aziJZCMMHXlGPU9gVDJWm65Sv_uhZyXxUu60iEc50UWP4_eYt5Mn9co-Seue-Qq4wUk2edBL0XqT3ayrcOgu7r1lvq8XTlnq7-M-Q5AAHOnwYu4isadApBY4i7p_UNiGETvz1wSpJ/s16000/코코스 강좌.jpg\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 4px 12px; width: 100%;\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n", "author": {"id": "04783440165843078075", "displayName": "리카수니", "url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04783440165843078075", "image": {"url": "//blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEij7m3uPaqJtF6qA_dfqRr4d9tEsZo_dlxVjEX1jRjybBZql7Kw8ry27dA0fV7SMK2ZO0doLsUCW3qnywwK9fBo6V4RG-xog5avEICcLozp6-6Y5S4EhVssm7E80YhbgdwrIS3tWvNg80AYkO_VySJW4znl3OOr7iDwg3X_7AeTpMViKg/s35/%E1%84%89